## Summary

This docs-only draft adds one consolidated bilingual RFC for vLLM weight reload:

- V1 reload for matching dtype and checkpoint format;
- V2 reload with online-quantizing parameter loaders;
- a complete scenario matrix covering BF16, block/per-tensor FP8, NVFP4, MXFP8/INT8, GPTQ/AWQ/Marlin, and MLA-derived state;
- smallest independently quantizable units with eager input release;
- one-shard-at-a-time transport, key-set coverage, backpressure, and failure semantics;
- backend applicability and H200/NCCL prototype evidence.

The English and Chinese versions are integrated into a single article:

- `docs/design/weight_reload_rfc.md`

No implementation or test code is included.

